    {
      "seg_id": 16,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "7. 연구요약",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "Several studies showed that fractional flow reserve is determined by the demand of myocardial blood flow rathern than epicardial stensois severity alone.",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 17,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "7. 연구요약",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "This study was aimed to see the meaning of coronary vasoreacitity expressed by further pressure drop during adnosine induced hyperemia in coronary pressure wire.",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 18,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "7. 연구요약",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "Coronary vasoreactivity was defined as \"baseline Pd/Pa - hyperemic Pd/Pa(Pd: pressure of coronary lumen distal to lesion, Pa: pressure of aorta)\".",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 19,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "7. 연구요약",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "In this study, delta FFR was defined as a parameter of vasoreactivity in which partial balloon obstruction and pressure wire was used.",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 20,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "7. 연구요약",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "The hypothesis of this study is that coronary vasoreactity is influenced by the amount of scar tissure in a way of inverse relationship.",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 21,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "7. 연구요약",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "Cardiac MRI is used for measurement scar tissue in this study.",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 22,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "8. 연구설계_중재상세설명",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "Patients with acute coronary syndrome will be enrolled in this study.",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 23,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "8. 연구설계_중재상세설명",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "After successful PCI in culprit of infarct related artery, artificial obstruction with balloon in stented segment was made in order to set the value of baseline Pd /Pao to 0.8.",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 24,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "8. 연구설계_중재상세설명",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "And then the drop of the final Pd/Pao from the baseline value (0.8) during maximal hyperemia was defined as ΔFFR0.8.",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 25,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "8. 연구설계_중재상세설명",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "Each ΔFFR0.8 was compared with cardiac MRI findings including delyaled hyperenhacement imaging.",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 26,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "8. 연구설계_군_1.중재군_군명",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "delta FFR 0.8 group",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 27,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "9. 대상자선정기준_대상자 포함기준_내용",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "① In case of acute coronary syndrome, culprit lesion is documented in proximal or middle segment of major epicardial coronary arteries.",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 28,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "9. 대상자선정기준_대상자 포함기준_내용",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "② reference vessel size is equal or greater than 3 mm in diameter so that stents used for this lesion are 3 mm or 3.5 mm in diameter.",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 29,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "9. 대상자선정기준_대상자 포함기준_내용",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "③ No history of previous myocardial infarction other than target vessel territory.",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 30,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "9. 대상자선정기준_대상자 제외기준",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "① Left main disease ② significant stenosis (defined by more than 50% of diameter stenosis) distal to taget lesion ③ if there is relatively big branch vessel ( defined by more than 50% of diameter stenosis) with significant stenosis in target vessel.",
      "align_score": null
    },
    {
      "seg_id": 31,
      "type": "sentence",
      "section": "9. 대상자선정기준_대상자 제외기준",
      "path": null,
      "ko_txt": null,
      "en_txt": "④ Left ventricle fraction < 30% ⑤ severe left ventricle hypertrophy (>12mm) or hypertrophic cardiomyopathy ⑥ creatinine > 2mg/dl",
      "align_score": null
    },
